  ],
  "patternRefs": [
    "DPK-PAT-3095"
  ],
  "remediation": "Point the declaration or the registry configuration at the namespace the project controls, and remove the lookup path that resolves elsewhere. Specifically: fix a relocation block that redirects the module.",
  "limitation": "It matches a relocation block that redirects the module in the parsed pom.xml; it cannot tell whether the package is installed, whether any published version is affected by an advisory, or whether the dependency reaches production code."
}
